HST Office: Writer's Margins menu (ribbon Layout > Margins, sidebar Page) gets Word's Moderate preset, "Vừa":
top and bottom 2.54 cm, left and right 1.91 cm, after Normal in both orientations.

- One button (hstmoderate) for portrait and landscape; in landscape it is moved after normalL.
- The labels Bình thường and Dọc/Ngang come from l10n/vi-overrides.jsonl.

License: these upstream files remain under their original license (MPL-2.0).
Test: tests/runtime/check-dialogs-writer.py margin-presets
